# Install by running `crontab -e` and copying the schedule line below.
# Compatibility entrypoint for the daily flywheel; replace the repository path.
# Run every day at 03:00 in the machine's local timezone.
# Configure vision/review models, tokenizer and source policy; run preflight first.
# The script creates logs/ and redirects its own output.
0 3 * * * /absolute/path/to/FinFlow/scripts/run_collection.sh
